WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:10.304
Summer is a wonderful season to play.

2
00:00:10.305 --> 00:00:14.869
It can be hot, but fun.

3
00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.164
Dad: Let's divide into two teams.

4
00:00:17.164 --> 00:00:18.545
Where's Mom?

5
00:00:18.546 --> 00:00:20.189
Mom: I am here.

6
00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.913
Hana: Let's do rock, paper, scissors.

7
00:00:23.914 --> 00:00:34.317
Everyone: Rock, paper, scissors!

8
00:00:34.318 --> 00:00:37.276
Bada: Dad! We are a team!

9
00:00:37.277 --> 00:00:40.609
Hana: All right! I am with Mom.

10
00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:45.602
Dad: When you get hit, you are out of the game.

11
00:00:45.603 --> 00:00:48.068
Bada: Can I catch the ball?

12
00:00:48.069 --> 00:00:49.561
Dad: Yes, you can.

13
00:00:49.562 --> 00:00:52.930
When you catch the ball, it is your team's turn.

14
00:00:52.931 --> 00:00:57.944
Dad: Remember not to throw it in anyone's face.

15
00:00:57.945 --> 00:01:03.293
Hana: Here it goes! Darn!

16
00:01:03.294 --> 00:01:05.426
Bada: It's my turn now.

17
00:01:05.427 --> 00:01:11.509
Ha-ya! I got you, Hana!

18
00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:14.055
Mom: No, Hana dodged the ball.

19
00:01:14.056 --> 00:01:15.804
Here it goes!

20
00:01:15.805 --> 00:01:20.087
Bada: Dad, look out!

21
00:01:20.088 --> 00:01:22.841
We had so much fun!

22
00:01:22.842 --> 00:01:28.945
Sorry, Hada! You can play with us when you're a little bigger.
